    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Portugal is closing approximately 8,000 schools and suspending non-essential public services as Storm Charles approaches, and the second day of the Web Summit in Lisbon is cancelled.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-11:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Red wind warnings for 11 November ran from 09:00 to 21:00 in Beja, Faro and Setúbal, and from 12:00 to 21:00 in Évora, Leiria, Lisbon, Portalegre and Santarém.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385700550:130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "This is the twelfth occurrence of the continent's coordinated severe weather naming programme, the 2026–27 European windstorm season.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385700550:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-11T00:00:34Z",
      "text": "The story is reported by AP and Deadline.",
